Slice 074, `tln tool update talon` and the attestation (entry `commands`): R-S2, R-IS3, R-SE13. The entry says 0.1.0. Each run sets `TALON_NOW`, so another release is the newest that is old enough (R-T9). The fake `programs` has `gh`. The job rules with `@<n>|` answer in the run n only.
